#Section 2 = Overview
This is a sophisticated UI specification that blends the "Glassmorphism" trend with the spatial design language found in visionOS.

To execute this, I have created a single-file HTML application. I opted for high-performance CSS3 over Three.js for the UI layer itself, as CSS backdrop-filter and box-shadow offer sharper text rendering and better native performance for interface elements than WebGL textures.

Here is the fully functional Liquid Glass Teleprompter prototype.

How to Use
Copy the code block below.

Save it as an .html file (e.g., teleprompter.html).

Open it in any modern browser (Safari or Chrome recommended for best glass effects).

#Section 3 = HTML CODE
